WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.602
Vinnie and Mandy walked down the streets of Florence with Leo.

2
00:00:06.603 --> 00:00:12.513
As they walked, Mandy thought there must be something special about the boy.

3
00:00:12.514 --> 00:00:15.448
Everyone seemed to like him.

4
00:00:15.449 --> 00:00:19.264
Vinnie said, "Mandy, look up!"

5
00:00:19.265 --> 00:00:21.794
Mandy lifted her head.

6
00:00:21.795 --> 00:00:26.908
People were looking down at them from open windows and balconies.

7
00:00:26.909 --> 00:00:31.539
"Why is everyone staring at us?" Vinnie asked.

8
00:00:31.540 --> 00:00:36.731
Leo laughed. "They’re not staring at you.

9
00:00:36.732 --> 00:00:40.746
They’re just enjoying the view from their balconies."

10
00:00:40.747 --> 00:00:45.140
"Enjoying the view of the street?" asked Mandy.

11
00:00:45.141 --> 00:00:49.260
"Yes! Watching people is fun! Look!"

12
00:00:49.261 --> 00:00:52.431
Leo opened his notebook.

13
00:00:52.432 --> 00:00:58.419
The pages were filled with extraordinary pictures of people and animals.

14
00:00:58.420 --> 00:01:04.017
"Leo! You’re amazing!" Mandy gasped.

15
00:01:04.018 --> 00:01:08.993
"No wonder your teacher says you’re gifted!" exclaimed Vinnie.

16
00:01:08.994 --> 00:01:12.488
Leo shrugged and closed his notebook.

17
00:01:12.489 --> 00:01:17.209
"Tell us about the Medici family," asked Mandy.

18
00:01:17.210 --> 00:01:22.352
"They are the most powerful family in Florence," said Leo.

19
00:01:22.353 --> 00:01:26.142
"What do they want you to do?" asked Vinnie.

20
00:01:26.143 --> 00:01:29.285
"All artists need supporters.

21
00:01:29.286 --> 00:01:33.930
Powerful families such as the Medici hire artists.

22
00:01:33.931 --> 00:01:39.147
Master Verrocchio’s workshop does a lot of work for them," said Leo.

23
00:01:39.148 --> 00:01:42.998
"We make furniture and portraits of their family.

24
00:01:42.999 --> 00:01:46.735
We even make their kitchen utensils."

25
00:01:46.736 --> 00:01:50.336
Leo stopped in front of a large estate.

26
00:01:50.337 --> 00:01:53.050
"Here we are!" he said.

27
00:01:53.051 --> 00:01:59.206
Leo led them through a gate and into a courtyard with a lovely garden.

28
00:01:59.207 --> 00:02:04.623
"My lord Lorenzo is expecting you, sir," said a servant by the door.

29
00:02:04.624 --> 00:02:09.820
He took them inside the palace and into a large courtyard.

30
00:02:09.821 --> 00:02:13.934
"Whoa!" Vinnie said loudly.

31
00:02:13.935 --> 00:02:17.128
"It looks like a museum!"

32
00:02:17.129 --> 00:02:20.911
The stone walls were decorated with carvings.

33
00:02:20.912 --> 00:02:26.187
"The family must really love art," remarked Mandy.

34
00:02:26.188 --> 00:02:31.475
"Leo!" called a young man about seventeen years old.

35
00:02:31.476 --> 00:02:34.557
He came toward them and smiled.

36
00:02:34.558 --> 00:02:39.664
He wore a shirt with puffy sleeves and a high lace collar.

37
00:02:39.665 --> 00:02:44.797
"Welcome," he said. "Please have a seat."

38
00:02:44.798 --> 00:02:46.713
"These are my friends,"

39
00:02:46.714 --> 00:02:50.891
Leo said, introducing Vinnie and Mandy.

40
00:02:50.892 --> 00:02:54.088
A servant brought in some cakes.

41
00:02:54.089 --> 00:02:58.368
"I am a great admirer of you, Leo," said Lorenzo.

42
00:02:58.369 --> 00:03:01.051
"You and I have a lot in common."

43
00:03:01.052 --> 00:03:04.857
"In what way, my lord?" asked Leo.

44
00:03:04.858 --> 00:03:08.482
"We’re both young," began Lorenzo.

45
00:03:08.483 --> 00:03:10.665
"We’re both intelligent.

46
00:03:10.666 --> 00:03:13.332
And we both love art."

47
00:03:13.333 --> 00:03:17.277
Leo nodded, but remained quiet.

48
00:03:17.278 --> 00:03:25.052
"One day, I will make Florence the most beautiful city in the world," Lorenzo said confidently.

49
00:03:25.053 --> 00:03:29.018
"And I believe you and I can do that together."

50
00:03:29.019 --> 00:03:33.883
"Florence is already magnificent," replied Leo.

51
00:03:33.884 --> 00:03:40.905
"I agree. But I intend to make it more so." Lorenzo laughed.

52
00:03:40.906 --> 00:03:48.267
"Then people will say, ‘He is Lorenzo, the one who made Florence magnificent!’"

53
00:03:48.268 --> 00:03:50.985
Mandy choked on her cake.

54
00:03:50.986 --> 00:03:55.296
Finally she realized who this man was.

55
00:03:55.297 --> 00:04:01.246
"He’s Lorenzo the Magnificent!" she wanted to scream.

56
00:04:01.247 --> 00:04:09.555
She was eating cake with the future ruler of Florence, Italy!

